From 9957674b187c6a83fb2e08791ee0bc23fac44606 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 23 May 2026 20:52:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Improve security, accessibility, SEO, and code quality

- Security: add rel="noopener noreferrer" to all external links
- Security: upgrade Schema.org @context URLs from http:// to https://
- SEO: add robots meta tag with max-image-preview directives
- SEO: set og:image fallback to profile photo, add og:description
- SEO: add og:type="website" default for non-article pages
- Accessibility: replace empty alt="" on archive images with post title
- Accessibility: add aria-hidden="true" to all academic icon links
- Accessibility: replace IE9 notice with noscript fallback
- Performance: add loading="lazy" to archive teaser images
- Performance: add dns-prefetch and preconnect hints in head.html
- Performance: fix hardcoded favicon path to use base_path variable
- Code quality: replace inline style="font-size: smaller" with .citation-text
- Code quality: fix undefined userPref variable in theme detection
- Code quality: fix var toggleTheme -> const in _main.js
- Code quality: add try-catch around JSON.parse for Plotly blocks

https://claude.ai/code/session_01SWH71k9A9hQYAYph49Xc7v
